# CarSlot UX case study — theme approval package

This folder is intentionally isolated from every existing project output.

## Files

- `DESIGN.md` — the proposed visual system for the full case-study website.
- `index.html` — a standalone, navigable preview of the proposed system.

## Current scope

This is the visual-direction approval stage only. It demonstrates the hero, navigation, process storytelling, research cards, information-architecture tree, user-flow diagram, screen presentation, validation treatment, and final-product CTA.

The full UX case-study content will be produced only after this theme is approved.

## Reference boundary

The direction is an independent CarSlot adaptation informed by the public Nguyan creative-agency case study on Behance. No source artwork, branding, proprietary imagery, or original layouts are included.
